---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SMS Privacy Policy"
  description="How the Sunset Hills First Ward temple recommend reminder text program handles your information."
>
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <h1>SMS Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Sunset Hills First Ward, Temple Recommend Reminder Program. Last updated August 2, 2026.</em></p>

    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how the Temple Recommend Reminder Program ("we," "us," or "our"),
      operated by Keaton Wall on behalf of the Sunset Hills First Ward, collects, uses, and protects
      information in connection with our text message (SMS) reminders. By taking part in the program
      you agree to this policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>We collect only what is needed to send recommend renewal reminders:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your name</li>
      <li>Your mobile phone number</li>
      <li>Your temple recommend expiration date and status</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This information comes from official ward records kept by local leadership.</p>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <p>
      Your information is used only to send you reminder text messages when your temple recommend is
      approaching or has passed its expiration date, and to help you schedule a renewal appointment.
      We do not use it for advertising or any unrelated purpose.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing of mobile information</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>We do not sell, rent, or share your mobile phone number, SMS opt-in, or consent with any
      third party.</strong> No mobile information is shared with third parties or affiliates for
      marketing or promotional purposes. Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent are never
      shared with anyone.
    </p>
    <p>
      The only outside processing is with our messaging provider, Twilio, which transmits the messages
      on our behalf and is not permitted to use your information for any other purpose. We may disclose
      information only if required by law.
    </p>

    <h2>Message frequency</h2>
    <p>
      Message frequency varies. Recipients typically receive no more than a few messages per year, sent
      only as a temple recommend approaches or passes its expiration date.
    </p>

    <h2>Message and data rates</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong> Any charges are billed by your mobile carrier
      under your own plan, and we have no control over them.
    </p>

    <h2>Opting out and getting help</h2>
    <p>
      You can opt out at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong>. After you reply STOP we will not
      send further reminders unless you opt back in. For help, reply <strong>HELP</strong> or contact
      Keaton Wall at <a href="tel:+18018603443">801-860-3443</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Data security and retention</h2>
    <p>
      Program data is stored privately, and access is limited to authorized ward leadership. We keep
      information only as long as needed to run the reminder program.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date above shows the most recent
      revision.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy? Contact Keaton Wall, Sunset Hills First Ward, at
      <a href="tel:+18018603443">801-860-3443</a>.
    </p>

    <p>See also our <a href="/sms-terms">SMS Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
